hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2137","[AI-translation] Imraan bin Husain (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya Jannat waley aag walon mein pehchaaney jaatey hain? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Us ne kaha: To amal karney waley kyun amal kartey hain? Aap ne farmaya: Har ek uskey liye amal karta hai jiskay liye wo paida kya gaya hai. Ya jiskay liye use aasaan kya gaya hai. (Bukhari: 6596)"
"2138","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein khutba diya jo Aap ne us mein Qiyaamat tak koi cheez nahi chhori magar zikr ki. Use jis ne jaana jaana aur jis ne na jaana na jaana. Beshak main cheez ko dekhta hun jo main bhool chuka hun aur use pehchaanta hun jaisa aadmi pehchaanta hai jab wo us se ghaaeb ho aur use dekhay aur pehchaaney. (Bukhari: 6604)"
"2139","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aadam key betey ko nazr kisi cheez key sath nahi aati jo main ne muqaddar nahi ki thi. Lekin use qadr daalti hai jabke main ne use uskey liye muqaddar kya hai. Main uskey sath bakheel se nikaalta hun. (Bukhari: 6609)"
"2140","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Khalifa muqarrar nahi kya jaata magar uskey do saathi hotey hain: Saathi jo use bhalai ka hukm deta hai aur use us par ubhaarta hai. Aur saathi jo use buraai ka hukm deta hai aur use us par ubhaarta hai. Aur maasoom wo hai jise Allah bachaaye. (Bukhari: 6611)"
"2141","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aksar qasam khaatey they: Nahi, dilon ko palat-ney waley ki qasam! (Bukhari: 6617). Qasmon aur nazron ki kitaab."
